{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他决定不再隐藏对对方的喜欢，即使对方有时不需要他，也愿意继续陪在身边。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、珍惜、坦然、心疼，夹杂不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"对方以后愿不愿意接受他的陪伴，不是他能决定的；正是想到这一点，刚才的欢喜才变成心口发疼。粉色短语和右侧阶段词也很难在一眼内全部读懂。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他开始愿意坦然表达喜欢，也愿意继续陪伴对方，不再觉得自己的在乎有什么不好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、释然、珍惜，同时有心疼和担忧\",\n      \"missed\": \"欢喜背后的不确定性：他可以决定自己愿意陪伴，却不能决定对方以后是否还需要自己。第二、第三段之间的因果关系需要逐句读才能完全理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他终于不再藏着喜欢，愿意陪伴对方，但也意识到对方未来的选择不由自己决定。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、期待、珍惜、心疼、不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的等待下一股浪潮、期待得到满足，虽然能增加期待感，但具体在等待什么、期待什么仍不明确；同时，欢喜转为心疼的完整原因仍需要读第三段。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上半屏三段字号相近、都很醒目的长句同时争夺注意力，核心的“不再隐藏喜欢”比较容易抓到，但“为什么欢喜又变成心疼”需要读完后两段才能串起来。粉色和紫色短语数量较多，其中部分缺少明确的情境锚点；下半屏金色点线动画主要提供音乐氛围，没有进一步帮助理解人物处境。整体故事和情绪实际上是连贯的，问题主要在于一眼扫读时需要同时处理的信息太多，核心转折不够集中。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "37911691-d520-444f-8b15-ce27fe68fb0a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003633530823Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:37:53.807771+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "15259f1c104c600baa21ae9887bb6d37a31b2a739ae58db6c5af2433a3b4a931", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003633530823Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7d34bb69bf0252524c950e5e5347b7f80ea0f22277bdb66cd7604823ae01f273"}}}
